  {
    "id": 7006001040010,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "プロデューサー\r\n第２審査の結果、もう出たのかい？",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700600104/7006001040010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ……\r\n残念だが、今回は駄目だったよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7006001040020,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "そうか……\r\n第１審査を通過して、少し油断していたのかもしれないな",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700600104/7006001040020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、咲耶はよくがんばってくれたよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "この間の撮影の仕事でも、感じていたんだ\r\n咲耶は、アイドルとして着実に成長しているぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7006001040030,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "クス。ありがとう、プロデューサー",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700600104/7006001040030"
  },
  {
    "id": 7006001040040,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "私を応援してくれるファンのためにも\r\nこんなところで落ち込んでいられないね",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700600104/7006001040040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな\r\n咲耶はまだまだこれからだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7006001040050,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ああ、私もそのつもりだよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700600104/7006001040050"
  },
  {
    "id": 7006001040060,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ファンのみんなを笑顔にできるように\r\nレッスンも仕事も、今まで以上にがんばろう！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700600104/7006001040060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あぁ、それでこそ咲耶だ！\r\n一緒にがんばっていこうな！",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
